  "prefLabel": "Env-A 704.03 Billing for Testing and Monitoring Fees for Temporary Permits",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 704.03 Billing for Testing and Monitoring Fees for Temporary Permits. The department shall bill the applicant, owner, or operator of a stationary source, area source, or device for the testing and monitoring fees after the completion of the required testing and monitoring.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 700) #5033, eff 12-27-90; ss by #6057-B, eff 6-30-95; ss by #7880, eff 4-26-03; amd by #8111, eff 6-26-04; ss by #9911, eff 4-26-11; ss by #12649, eff 10-24-18",
